[WOTCArchipelago_UISL_TechHints]
strItemPrefix="Item: "
strPlayerPrefix="\nPlayer: "

strClassProgression="Progression"
strClassUseful="Useful"
strClassTrap="Trap"
strClassNormal="Normal"

+arrProgressionHints="Commander, this research appears to be vital to the operations of one of our allies."
+arrProgressionHints="Prior tests have revealed this research to be of the utmost importance, commander."
+arrProgressionHints="Commander, all the evidence points towards this line of research as the next step forward."
+arrProgressionHints="Cooperation with our allies is crucial, commander, and our allies need... whatever this is."
+arrProgressionHints="To the untrained eye, this might seem worthless, but something tells me it will be indispensable to us in the long run."
+arrProgressionHints="An urgent transmission from one of our allies just came in, asking for the speedy completion of this research."

+arrUsefulHints="I suspect this line of research will likely pay dividends for us and our allies."
+arrUsefulHints="We've received good intel that this research will help the resistance thrive."
+arrUsefulHints="This line of research might lend a hand to our allies, commander."
+arrUsefulHints="Shen's GREMLIN seemed excited about this research. Perhaps it knows something we don't?\n\nIts name is ROV-R, Tygan. -Shen"
+arrUsefulHints="I assure you, this project will be well worth the investment, commander."
+arrUsefulHints="Although it may not seem like it to us, I'm confident this research will prove useful to one of our allies."

+arrTrapHints="Shen says she has a bad feeling about this one..."
+arrTrapHints="We should be careful with the research we conduct, commander. The aliens may have left behind some painful surprises for us."
+arrTrapHints="Commander, it may just be my paranoia, but I'm beginning to question whether we're not playing into the aliens' hands."
+arrTrapHints="If there's one thing I learned during my time working for the aliens, it's that some things should better be left untouched."
+arrTrapHints="Some research may have adverse effects, commander. We should proceed with utmost caution."

+arrNormalHints="This research may not be worth our time..."
+arrNormalHints="We might benefit from focusing our attention elsewhere, commander."
+arrNormalHints="Our resources are limited, commander. We shouldn't waste them needlessly."
+arrNormalHints="Pursuing this line of research is certainly... an option."
+arrNormalHints="I was hoping for something a little more exciting, personally."
+arrNormalHints="If I may, commander, I don't think this research should be our top priority."

strNoHint="Only one way to find out..."
